DOT DASH FIRMWARE — PROPRIETARY LICENSE (BINARY DISTRIBUTION)

This repository distributes compiled firmware images (the "Firmware") for Dot
Dash devices. The Firmware is the proprietary property of the copyright holder.

WHY THIS REPOSITORY IS PUBLIC

Dot Dash devices fetch their updates directly from this repository over the
public internet. The files must therefore be readable without authentication.
That accessibility is a technical requirement of the update mechanism. It is
not a grant of rights, and it does not place the Firmware in the public domain.

WHAT IS PERMITTED

The copyright holder grants a limited, non-exclusive, non-transferable,
revocable licence to download and install the Firmware onto genuine Dot Dash
hardware, for the purpose of operating that hardware.

WHAT IS NOT PERMITTED

Without prior written permission you may not:

  * redistribute, mirror, resell, or bundle the Firmware;
  * install or run it on any hardware other than genuine Dot Dash devices;
  * modify or patch it, or distribute anything derived from it;
  * reverse engineer, decompile, or disassemble it, except to the extent that
    right cannot lawfully be excluded; or
  * extract, reuse, or publish any credential, key, endpoint, or other
    embedded material recovered from it.

The last point is not merely contractual: these images address live services
used by children. Responsible-disclosure reports are welcomed and should go to
the copyright holder rather than being published.

"Dot Dash" and the Dot Dash logo are trademarks of the copyright holder. No
right to use them is granted by this licence.

The Firmware incorporates third-party components under their own licences,
